{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++0x code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++0x code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <iostream>\n#include <cmath>\n#include <algorithm>\n#include <limits>\n#include <type_traits>\nusing namespace std;\n\nusing lint = long long;\n\nlint gcd(lint a, lint b) {\n    if (!a || !b) return a | b;\n    int shift = __builtin_ctzll(a | b);\n    a >>= __builtin_ctzll(a);\n    do {\n        b >>= __builtin_ctzll(b);\n        if (a > b) swap(a, b);\n        b -= a;\n    } while (b);\n    return a << shift;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    lint x, y, n;\n    cin >> x >> y >> n;\n\n    lint best_num = 0, best_den = 1;\n    double min_error = numeric_limits<double>::max();\n\n    for (lint d = 1; d <= n; ++d) {\n        lint num1 = 0;\n        lint left = 0, right = 100000;\n        while (left <= right) {\n            lint mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n            if (mid * y <= x * d) {\n                num1 = mid;\n                left = mid + 1;\n            } else {\n                right = mid - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        lint num2 = 0;\n        left = 0, right = 100000;\n        while (left <= right) {\n            lint mid = left + (right - left) / 2;\n            if (mid * y < x * d) {\n                left = mid + 1;\n            } else {\n                num2 = mid;\n                right = mid - 1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        double diff1 = fabs(static_cast<double>(num1) / d - static_cast<double>(x) / y);\n        double diff2 = fabs(static_cast<double>(num2) / d - static_cast<double>(x) / y);\n\n        lint final_num = num1;\n        lint final_den = d;\n        double final_diff = diff1;\n\n        if (diff2 < diff1 - 1e-11) {\n            final_num = num2;\n            final_den = d;\n            final_diff = diff2;\n        }\n\n        lint g = gcd(final_num, final_den);\n        final_num /= g;\n        final_den /= g;\n\n        if (final_diff < min_error) {\n            best_num = final_num;\n            best_den = final_den;\n            min_error = final_diff;\n        }\n    }\n\n    cout << best_num << \"/\" << best_den << endl;\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport math\nimport sys\n\ndef gcd(a, b):\n    if not a or not b:\n        return a | b\n    shift = 0\n    temp = a | b\n    while temp % 2 == 0:\n        shift += 1\n        temp //= 2\n    while a % 2 == 0:\n        a //= 2\n    while b:\n        while b % 2 == 0:\n            b //= 2\n        if a > b:\n            a, b = b, a\n        b -= a\n    return a << shift\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    x = int(data[0])\n    y = int(data[1])\n    n = int(data[2])\n    \n    best_num = 0\n    best_den = 1\n    min_error = float('inf')\n    \n    for d in range(1, n + 1):\n        # Binary search for num1: largest num such that num * y <= x * d\n        left, right = 0, 100000\n        num1 = 0\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n            if mid * y <= x * d:\n                num1 = mid\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        \n        # Binary search for num2: smallest num such that num * y >= x * d\n        left, right = 0, 100000\n        num2 = 0\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = left + (right - left) // 2\n            if mid * y < x * d:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                num2 = mid\n                right = mid - 1\n        \n        diff1 = abs(num1 / d - x / y)\n        diff2 = abs(num2 / d - x / y)\n        \n        final_num = num1\n        final_den = d\n        final_diff = diff1\n        \n        if diff2 < diff1 - 1e-11:\n            final_num = num2\n            final_den = d\n            final_diff = diff2\n        \n        g = gcd(final_num, final_den)\n        final_num //= g\n        final_den //= g\n        \n        if final_diff < min_error:\n            best_num = final_num\n            best_den = final_den\n            min_error = final_diff\n    \n    print(f\"{best_num}/{best_den}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00011121608258690685, -7.152555099310121e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.002504071919247508, -0.06203226372599602, -0.3868989646434784, -0.011090303771197796, -0.0002884448622353375, -1.0251946150674485e-05, -4.6967357775429264e-05, -0.0005231918767094612, -2.622600959512056e-06, -6.9141146923357155e-06, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -1.6689160474925302e-05, -1.3470558769768104e-05, -1.3708974620385561e-05, -0.5759487748146057, -9.536738616588991e-07, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -1.7881377516459906e-06, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -8.4638240878121e-06, -0.00016246906307060272, 0.0, -1.823885577323381e-05, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.023314278572797775, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.577143669128418, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -8.22540732769994e-06, -0.27472370862960815, -0.0002812943421304226, -0.0002331461873